15:21.859 --> 15:22.840
They are part of the glee club.

15:24.324 --> 15:28.647
They are known as, quote, ladies men with these white women in Bryan.

15:28.887 --> 15:32.430
So it raises questions of interracial relationships.

15:33.571 --> 15:34.571
So yeah, it's very exciting.

15:34.591 --> 15:38.054
It's probably what's going to be my master's thesis.

15:38.074 --> 15:39.015
So yeah, just fascinating.

15:39.475 --> 15:41.656
That was just a person, for me personally.

15:41.736 --> 15:46.280
Because I'm trying to put different pieces of this puzzle together from an outsider.

15:46.820 --> 15:50.182
There's so many pieces that just don't make sense yet.

15:50.623 --> 15:52.064
So there was a fire in 1912 that...

15:54.473 --> 16:04.955
like did away with the old main building, which has all of our records of where they slept, which I need to know, just a lot of those records that unfortunately are lost that would probably answer a lot of those questions.

16:05.615 --> 16:06.055
Um, but yeah.

16:06.075 --> 16:15.677
Do you want me to, I have over 2000 world histories from Aggies, their wives, don't they go through those and see what I, yes please.

16:15.957 --> 16:17.797
