Okay.

16:18.277 --> 16:19.398
Thank you so much.

16:19.498 --> 16:20.178
Yeah.

16:20.878 --> 16:21.878
Um, because this,

16:26.171 --> 16:33.357
Yes, so Chuck Kelly and Mike Valenti are probably the two biggest successes in terms of their football career while they're here.

16:34.518 --> 16:39.162
